Output site/assets/img/devtui-preview.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1120
Set Height 600
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Framerate 15

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "devtui"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "/uuid generator"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Down 3
Sleep 450ms
Enter
Sleep 2400ms
